    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk an er seems like a lot for just being tired and sore from sitting so long. its probably just because i didnt drink enough water on the plane and my muscles are cramped from the cramped seat. can i just take some ibuprofen and drink a bunch of electrolytes to see if it goes away? i really don't want to deal with a hospital visit if i can just nap it off.",
