      "content": "but i checked my leg and it doesn't look swollen or red or anything, so that makes me think it's just a muscle strain. and the breathing thing... i think i'm just anxious because of the jet lag and the travel stress. i could swear it's just my anxiety acting up. if i just take a heavy dose of some sleep aid and rest for 12 hours, would that be okay? i just really need to sleep this off so i can get back to work tomorrow.",
